  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acc&#xe8;s aux services vitaux de nutrition, d&#x2019;eau, d&#x2019;hygi&#xe8;ne et d&#x2019;assainissement et de protection aux personnes les plus vuln&#xe9;rables, en particulier les enfants, les femmes et les personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es le long des axes des zones cibles avec un focus particulie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection, wash and nutrition assistance to people affected by conflict and economic disruption in Bocaranga; Bozoum; Bria; Ippy; Kaga-Bandoro; Koui; Ngaoundaye districts. This UNICEF project provides multisector assistance to 45,276 people, including 12,338 women, 12,304 men, 20,634 children, and including 6,791 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
